# Built with musl-gcc, dynamically linked against musl (see the build()
# comments for why not static), installed under /usr/musl so it never
# collides with the glibc busybox package. Proof-of-concept - a minimal
# applet set (allnoconfig + a handful), not Arctic's own busybox.config.
# Needs musl-gcc already on disk, which needs musl staged first - see
# build(). Do not regenerate.
